cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline or its evaluation artifacts, please cite it as below."
title: "News Article Analysis and Topic Extraction: A Big Data Architecture & NLP Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end big data pipeline over news text: Hadoop ecosystem simulation
  (HDFS, YARN, MapReduce, Hive, HBase, Pig, Sqoop, Flume, Oozie, ZooKeeper),
  PySpark LDA topic modeling and VADER sentiment scoring, a Snappy Parquet
  lakehouse, MongoDB document storage, supervised Reuters-21578 classification,
  live RSS ingestion, Structured Streaming, topic-drift monitoring, Streamlit
  and offline Plotly dashboards.
authors:
